    <!--
      MentUI design tokens (single source of truth).
      Layouts should prefer MentUI names (maroon_*, bg, surface, ink, …).
      Legacy semantic aliases (surface_app, action_primary, …) map onto MentUI
      so existing screens pick up the restyle without a mass rename.
    -->

